uitive Understanding: Rendering Mental Models</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Mental Model 1: Construc=
tion Site</strong>
Rendering Engine nh=C6=B0 <strong>construction process</strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Blueprints</strong> (HT=
ML/CSS) define structure</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Foundation</strong> (DO=
M tree) provides base structure</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Framework</strong> (Lay=
out) determines positions</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Finishing</strong> (Pai=
nt) applies visual appearance</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Final Inspection</stron=
g> (Composite) ensures everything fits together</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Mental Model 2: Movie Pr=
oduction</strong>
Rendering pipeline nh=C6=B0 <strong>film production</strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Script</strong> (HTML) =
defines content</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Art Direction</strong> =
(CSS) defines visual style</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Set Construction</stron=
g> (Layout) builds physical spaces</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Cinematography</strong>=
 (Paint) captures visual elements</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Post-Production</strong=
> (Composite) combines everything into final result</li>
</ul>
