<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=92=A1 Int=
uitive Understanding: Execution Stack Mental Models</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Mental Model 1: Restaura=
nt Order System</strong>
Call Stack nh=C6=B0 <strong>restaurant kitchen order system</strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Orders</strong> (functi=
on calls) come in v=C3=A0 get <strong>stacked</strong></li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Chefs</strong> (executi=
on) work on <strong>top order first</strong> (LIFO)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Each order</strong> has=
 <strong>ingredients list</strong> (local variables)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Special requests</stron=
g> reference <strong>base recipes</strong> (closure variables)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Completed orders</stron=
g> get <strong>removed from stack</strong></li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Mental Model 2: Russian =
Nesting Dolls (Matryoshka)</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Each doll</strong> =3D =
Execution context</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Inner dolls</strong> =
=3D Nested function calls</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Doll's contents</strong=
> =3D Local variables v=C3=A0 parameters</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Opening dolls</strong> =
=3D Function invocation</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Closing dolls</strong> =
=3D Function return</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Complete set</strong> =
=3D Call stack</li>
</ul>
