<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=92=A1 Int=
uitive Understanding: Event Loop Mental Models</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Mental Model 1: Restaura=
nt Kitchen</strong>
Event Loop nh=C6=B0 <strong>restaurant kitchen operation</strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Order Queue</strong> =
=3D Macrotask Queue (customer orders)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Prep Tasks</strong> =3D=
 Microtask Queue (sauce preparation, garnishing)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Head Chef</strong> =3D =
Event Loop (coordinates everything)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Cooking Stations</stron=
g> =3D Browser Threads (grill, fryer, etc.)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Rule</strong>: Complete=
 ALL prep tasks before starting next order</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Mental Model 2: Post Off=
ice Sorting</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Mail Trucks</strong> =
=3D Browser Threads bringing events</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Sorting Bins</strong> =
=3D Different event queues</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Postal Worker</strong> =
=3D Event Loop processing mail</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Priority Mail</strong> =
=3D Microtasks (processed immediately)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Regular Mail</strong> =
=3D Macrotasks (processed in order)</li>
</ul>
