<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=92=A1 Int=
uitive Understanding: Macrotask Mental Models</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Mental Model 1: Post Off=
ice Mail Processing</strong>
Macrotasks nh=C6=B0 <strong>post office mail sorting</strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Mail delivery trucks</s=
trong> =3D Browser threads bringing tasks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Sorting center</strong>=
 =3D Event loop processing center</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Priority mail</strong> =
=3D High-priority macrotasks (user events)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Regular mail</strong> =
=3D Standard macrotasks (timers, I/O)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Postal workers</strong>=
 =3D Main thread processing one item at a time</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Delivery schedule</stro=
ng> =3D One piece of mail per processing cycle</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Mental Model 2: Airport =
Ground Control</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Incoming flights</stron=
g> =3D Macrotasks arriving from various sources</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Control tower</strong> =
=3D Event loop coordinating landings</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Runway</strong> =3D Mai=
n thread (only one plane lands at a time)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Priority aircraft</stro=
ng> =3D Emergency landings (user interactions)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Flight schedule</strong=
> =3D Timer-based macrotasks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Ground crew</strong> =
=3D Browser threads preparing aircraft</li>
</ul>
